  # Review: crev-recursive-digest 0.6.0
  
  - Local source: `/home/dpc/.cargo/registry/src/index.crates.io-1949cf8c6b5b557f/crev-recursive-digest-0.6.0`
  - Upstream repository: `https://github.com/crev-dev/recursive-digest` (NOTE: differs from `repository` field in Cargo.toml.orig — see finding #1)
