  no `reqwest`/`hyper`/`ureq`, no `include_bytes!`, no base64 literals, no obfuscated
  strings, no panics on untrusted input.
  
  ### Architectural summary
  
  This is a thin wrapper around `uniffi_bindgen::generate_component_scaffolding[_for_crate]`.
  It adds cargo build script integration (`rerun-if-changed` / `rerun-if-env-changed`
  directives) and reads `$OUT_DIR` so callers don't have to. The actual complexity lives
  entirely in the `uniffi_bindgen` dependency.
  
