  - No conditional compilation beyond `#[cfg_attr(docsrs, feature(doc_auto_cfg))]` which is standard docs.rs configuration
  - No `Drop` impls
  - No custom serde deserializers
  
  ## Cross-check against existing reviews
  
  No prior reviews of this crate at any version.
  
