  ## Claims baseline
  
  The crate claims to be a platform-specific proxy that re-exports `jiff-tzdb`, embedding the IANA Time Zone Database for platforms (primarily Windows) that lack a system copy. It exists solely to enable target-specific dependency resolution in Cargo, since target-specific features don't exist.
  
  ## External verification
  
