  - **src/layer_fn.rs** (114 lines) — **read in full**. `layer_fn` function and `LayerFn<F>`
    struct that adapts a closure into a `Layer`. Implements `Layer<S>` by calling the
    closure. Has a test for the `Debug` impl using `type_name`. Clean.
  
  - **src/stack.rs** (62 lines) — **read in full**. `Stack<Inner, Outer>` composes two
    layers. `Layer` impl applies inner first, then outer. Custom `Debug` impl formats
