  **Claims baseline:** The crate claims to be a fork of `byteorder` that sets
  `#![forbid(unsafe_code)]`, providing `ByteOrder`, `ReadBytesExt`, and `WriteBytesExt`
  traits for reading/writing integers in big-endian and little-endian byte order. It
