  - **Cargo.toml dependencies**: Zero runtime dependencies. Only dev-dependencies
    (`quickcheck`, `rand`) which don't affect users. Positive — matches the "pure
    encoding" claim.
  - **Proc-macro**: Not a proc-macro crate. Positive.
  - **unsafe blocks**: Zero. The crate has `#![forbid(unsafe_code)]` at line 68 of
